  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>Manim 的颜色核心是 <code>ManimColor</code>：几乎所有 <code>color</code> 参数（类型标注 <code>ParsableManimColor</code>）都能接受十六进制字符串、<code>ManimColor</code>、<code>HSV</code>/<code>RGBA</code> 实例或 RGB 元组，并统一转换到内部表示。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "ManimColor",
      "text": "ManimColor"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>ManimColor</code> 是不可变的颜色值对象，封装 RGB(A) 四个通道。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">ManimColor(&quot;#58C4DD&quot;)              # 十六进制\nManimColor((0.345, 0.769, 0.867))  # RGB 元组（0~1 浮点）\nManimColor(RED)                    # 从既有颜色构造\n</code></pre>\n<p>常用工厂与实例方法：</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "compare",
      "headers": [
        "方法",
        "签名",
        "作用"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "<code>from_hex</code>",
          "<code>(hex_str, alpha=1.0)</code>",
          "从 #RRGGBB 字符串构造"
        ],
        [
          "<code>from_hsv</code>",
          "<code>(hsv, alpha=1.0)</code>",
          "从 HSV 三元组（0~1）构造"
        ],
        [
          "<code>from_rgb</code> / <code>from_rgba</code>",
          "<code>(tuple, alpha)</code>",
          "从浮点元组构造"
        ],
        [
          "<code>interpolate</code>",
          "<code>(other, alpha)</code>",
          "与另一颜色按比例插值"
        ],
        [
          "<code>lighter</code> / <code>darker</code>",
          "<code>(blend=0.2)</code>",
          "向白/黑混合，提亮或压暗"
        ],
        [
          "<code>opacity</code>",
          "<code>(opacity)</code>",
          "返回带新不透明度的副本"
        ],
        [
          "<code>contrasting</code>",
          "<code>(threshold=0.5, light, dark)</code>",
          "按亮度返回黑或白（保证可读性）"
        ],
        [
          "<code>invert</code>",
          "<code>()</code>",
          "RGB 通道取反"
        ],
        [
          "<code>to_hex</code> / <code>to_rgb</code> / <code>to_rgba</code>",
          "<code>()</code>",
          "导出为字符串或 ndarray"
        ],
        [
          "<code>to_int_rgb</code> / <code>to_int_rgba</code>",
          "<code>()</code>",
          "导出 0~255 整数"
        ],
        [
          "<code>into</code>",
          "<code>(ManimColor)</code>",
          "把自身混入另一个颜色（原地语义）"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">base = ManimColor.from_hex(&quot;#58C4DD&quot;)\nbase.lighter(0.5)                       # 更浅的青\nbase.darker(0.5)                        # 更深的青\nbase.interpolate(PURE_RED, 0.6)         # 偏向红的混合色\nManimColor(&quot;#123456&quot;).contrasting()     # #FFFFFF（深底配白字）\n</code></pre>\n<p>常见坑：<code>ManimColor</code> 的方法都返回<strong>新对象</strong>，需要 <code>color = color.darker(0.3)</code> 接收；<code>ParsableManimColor</code> 注解表示“以上任意形式”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "demo",
      "example": "ch02/colors_demo",
      "scene": "ColorsDemo",
      "caption": "<p><code>ManimColor</code> 的提亮、压暗、插值与半透明变体并排展示；下方是 <code>color_gradient</code> 生成的 12 级渐变，以及 <code>RandomColorGenerator(seed=7)</code> 生成的可复现随机色。</p>",
      "code": "\"\"\"ColorsDemo: ManimColor interpolation, lighter/darker, gradient and palettes.\"\"\"\n\nfrom manim import *\n\n\nclass ColorsDemo(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        base = ManimColor.from_hex(\"#58C4DD\")\n        colors = [\n            base,\n            base.lighter(0.5),\n            base.darker(0.5),\n            base.interpolate(PURE_RED, 0.6),\n            base.opacity(0.35),\n        ]\n        squares = VGroup(\n            *[\n                Square(side_length=1.1, fill_opacity=1, stroke_width=0, color=c)\n                for c in colors\n            ]\n        ).arrange(RIGHT, buff=0.25)\n        self.play(FadeIn(squares))\n        self.wait(0.5)\n\n        gradient = color_gradient([BLUE_E, GREEN, YELLOW], 12)\n        dots = VGroup(\n            *[\n                Dot(radius=0.18, color=c)\n                for c in gradient\n            ]\n        ).arrange(RIGHT, buff=0.12).shift(DOWN * 1.5)\n        self.play(FadeIn(dots))\n\n        rcg = RandomColorGenerator(seed=7)\n        random_squares = VGroup(\n            *[\n                Square(side_length=0.6, fill_opacity=1, stroke_width=0, color=rcg.next())\n                for _ in range(5)\n            ]\n        ).arrange(RIGHT, buff=0.25).shift(DOWN * 3)\n        self.play(FadeIn(random_squares))\n        self.wait(1)\n",
      "video": null
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "HSV",
      "text": "HSV"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>HSV</code> 是 <code>ManimColor</code> 的子类，用 HSV 三元组（色相、饱和度、明度，均为 0~1 浮点）构造颜色，适合程序化生色。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">HSV((0.0, 1.0, 1.0))    # 纯红\nHSV((0.33, 0.8, 0.9))   # 偏绿的色调\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "HSV",
        "ManimColor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "RGBA",
      "text": "RGBA"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>RGBA</code> 与 <code>ManimColor</code> 平行的颜色表示，直接携带 alpha 通道，构造参数同 <code>ManimColor</code>（value + alpha）。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">RGBA((1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.5))   # 半透明红\n</code></pre>\n<p>常见坑：<code>RGBA</code> 不是 <code>ManimColor</code> 的子类（两者各自实现同一套接口）；在 <code>color=</code> 参数里 Manim 会自动解析，混用时以 <code>ParsableManimColor</code> 兼容为准。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "RandomColorGenerator",
      "text": "RandomColorGenerator"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>RandomColorGenerator</code> 按需从调色板中随机取色，支持种子复现。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>seed</code>",
          "type": "int \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>sample_colors</code>",
          "type": "list[ManimColor] \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">rcg = RandomColorGenerator(seed=42)      # 两次运行取色序列一致\nrcg.next()                               # 取下一个随机颜色\nrcg2 = RandomColorGenerator(sample_colors=[RED, GREEN, BLUE])\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "level": "tip",
      "title": "提示",
      "html": "<p>需要“每次渲染都不一样”的随机效果时，不传 seed 并用 CLI 的 <code>--seed</code> 或 <code>Scene(random_seed=...)</code> 控制整体可复现性。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "内置调色板",
      "text": "内置调色板"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>Manim 内置了一套品牌调色板。每个彩色系有 5 个亮度阶梯（<code>_A</code> 最浅、<code>_E</code> 最深），主色名（如 <code>BLUE</code>）取中间档：</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "compare",
      "headers": [
        "色系",
        "常量",
        "说明"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "蓝",
          "<code>BLUE_A</code> … <code>BLUE_E</code>、<code>BLUE</code>",
          "品牌主色系"
        ],
        [
          "青",
          "<code>TEAL_A</code> … <code>TEAL_E</code>、<code>TEAL</code>",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "绿",
          "<code>GREEN_A</code> … <code>GREEN_E</code>、<code>GREEN</code>",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "黄",
          "<code>YELLOW_A</code> … <code>YELLOW_E</code>、<code>YELLOW</code>",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "金",
          "<code>GOLD_A</code> … <code>GOLD_E</code>、<code>GOLD</code>",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "红",
          "<code>RED_A</code> … <code>RED_E</code>、<code>RED</code>",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "栗",
          "<code>MAROON_A</code> … <code>MAROON_E</code>、<code>MAROON</code>",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "紫",
          "<code>PURPLE_A</code> … <code>PURPLE_E</code>、<code>PURPLE</code>",
          ""
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>灰色系有美式/英式<strong>双拼写</strong>，逐对相等（<code>GRAY == GREY</code>）：</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "compare",
      "headers": [
        "常量",
        "说明"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "<code>GRAY_A</code> … <code>GRAY_E</code> / <code>GREY_A</code> … <code>GREY_E</code>",
          "五级灰"
        ],
        [
          "<code>GRAY</code> / <code>GREY</code>、<code>DARK_GRAY</code> / <code>DARK_GREY</code>",
          "中灰、深灰"
        ],
        [
          "<code>DARKER_GRAY</code> / <code>DARKER_GREY</code>",
          "更深的灰"
        ],
        [
          "<code>LIGHT_GRAY</code> / <code>LIGHT_GREY</code>、<code>LIGHTER_GRAY</code> / <code>LIGHTER_GREY</code>",
          "浅灰"
        ],
        [
          "<code>GRAY_BROWN</code>、<code>DARK_BROWN</code>、<code>LIGHT_BROWN</code>",
          "棕色系"
        ],
        [
          "<code>BLACK</code>、<code>WHITE</code>、<code>PINK</code>、<code>LIGHT_PINK</code>、<code>ORANGE</code>",
          "独立色"
        ],
        [
          "<code>PURE_RED</code>、<code>PURE_GREEN</code>、<code>PURE_BLUE</code>、<code>PURE_CYAN</code>、<code>PURE_MAGENTA</code>、<code>PURE_YELLOW</code>",
          "通道纯值（绘图/示波风格）"
        ],
        [
          "<code>LOGO_WHITE</code>、<code>LOGO_BLACK</code>、<code>LOGO_BLUE</code>、<code>LOGO_GREEN</code>、<code>LOGO_RED</code>",
          "官方 Logo 用色"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "颜色工具函数",
      "text": "颜色工具函数"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>manim.utils.color</code> 还提供一组模块级工具函数：</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "compare",
      "headers": [
        "函数",
        "签名",
        "作用"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "<code>average_color</code>",
          "<code>(*colors)</code>",
          "多颜色（加权）平均"
        ],
        [
          "<code>color_gradient</code>",
          "<code>(reference_colors, length_of_output)</code>",
          "生成参考色之间的渐变列表"
        ],
        [
          "<code>interpolate_color</code>",
          "<code>(color1, color2, alpha)</code>",
          "两色插值（<code>ManimColor.interpolate</code> 的函数版）"
        ],
        [
          "<code>invert_color</code>",
          "<code>(color)</code>",
          "颜色取反"
        ],
        [
          "<code>random_color</code>",
          "<code>()</code>",
          "返回一个随机内置颜色"
        ],
        [
          "<code>hex_to_rgb</code>",
          "<code>(hex_string)</code>",
          "<code>#RRGGBB</code> → RGB 数组"
        ],
        [
          "<code>rgb_to_hex</code>",
          "<code>(rgb_array)</code>",
          "RGB 数组 → <code>#RRGGBB</code>"
        ],
        [
          "<code>color_to_rgb</code> / <code>color_to_rgba</code>",
          "<code>(color)</code>",
          "任意可解析颜色 → 数组"
        ],
        [
          "<code>rgb_to_color</code> / <code>rgba_to_color</code>",
          "<code>(array)</code>",
          "数组 → <code>ManimColor</code>"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">color_gradient([BLUE_E, GREEN, YELLOW], 12)   # 12 级渐变\naverage_color(RED, BLUE)                      # 两色平均\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "level": "tip",
      "title": "提示",
      "html": "<p>老教程中的 <code>BLUE</code> 等颜色在旧版是字符串、可以 <code>+</code> 拼接取平均；v0.21.0 它们是 <code>ManimColor</code> 对象，颜色混合请用 <code>average_color</code> 或 <code>interpolate_color</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "更多颜色常量模块",
      "text": "更多颜色常量模块"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>除内置调色板外，<code>manim.utils.color</code> 下还有六个大型命名色表模块，每个模块直接以属性形式提供颜色常量：</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "compare",
      "headers": [
        "模块",
        "来源"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "<code>manim.utils.color.XKCD</code>",
          "XKCD 颜色调查（924 色，如 <code>XKCD.ACIDGREEN</code>）"
        ],
        [
          "<code>manim.utils.color.SVGNAMES</code>",
          "SVG 命名色（如 <code>SVGNAMES.LIGHTSKYBLUE</code>）"
        ],
        [
          "<code>manim.utils.color.DVIPSNAMES</code>",
          "LaTeX dvips 色（如 <code>DVIPSNAMES.NAVYBLUE</code>）"
        ],
        [
          "<code>manim.utils.color.X11</code>",
          "X11 颜色（如 <code>X11.LIGHTSKYBLUE</code>）"
        ],
        [
          "<code>manim.utils.color.AS2700</code>",
          "澳大利亚标准 AS2700（如 <code>AS2700.N53_BLUE_GREY</code>）"
        ],
        [
          "<code>manim.utils.color.BS381</code>",
          "英国标准 BS381（如 <code>BS381.AIRCRAFT_BLUE</code>）"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "常见错误与建议",
      "text": "常见错误与建议"
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "level": "warning",
      "title": "常见错误",
      "html": "<p>向 <code>color=</code> 传十六进制字符串时别忘了 <code>#</code>：<code>ManimColor(\"58C4DD\")</code> 会解析失败；正确写法 <code>ManimColor(\"#58C4DD\")</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "自测",
      "text": "自测"
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "questionHtml": "<p>如何生成一个从 <code>RED</code> 到 <code>BLUE</code>、共 7 个颜色的列表，并把第 3 个颜色设为一条线的颜色？</p>",
      "answerHtml": "<p>用 <code>color_gradient</code> 一次生成，按下标取值：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">palette = color_gradient([RED, BLUE], 7)\nline = Line(LEFT, RIGHT, color=palette[2])\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "questionHtml": "<p>深色的标题文字 <code>ManimColor(\"#0A1444\")</code> 想配一个自动可读的强调色（深色配白、浅色配黑），怎么做？</p>",
      "answerHtml": "<p>用 <code>contrasting()</code>，它按颜色亮度自动返回黑或白：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">title_color = ManimColor(&quot;#0A1444&quot;)\naccent = title_color.contrasting()   # 深色 -&gt; WHITE；也可传 threshold 调阈值\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "下一步",
      "text": "下一步"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>到这里基础图形板块接近尾声：你已经掌握了线、圆弧、布尔组合、标注与颜色。下一板块进入文本与公式。</p>"
    }
